t kartlägga de mest angelägna miljöerna/platserna, ex. evenemangsplats eller fornlämningsmiljö med besökskvalité). Ange om miljön är inomhus eller utomhus."},"dct:identifier":"ds_kuf_kultur_fritidsobjekt_p_kultur_kulturell_besoksmal","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000068"},"dct:subject":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/society"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kulturellt besöksmål/kulturhistorisk miljö"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedAttribution":{"@id":"_:9dbbe0f2423716b7e74010618fd96d5f41d8a169fdb538b258af72ed552b8f3d_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:9dbbe0f2423716b7e74010618fd96d5f41d8a169fdb538b258af72ed552b8f3d"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:9dcd979c0e6ab983e51dbe289866c2574dcf67bcff3357d3779c12c46d80e180_b0n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Attribution","dcat:hadRole":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResponsiblePartyRole/owner"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#agent":{"@id":"https://metadatakatalog.huddinge.se/store/25/resource/1"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000068","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120000068","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:gis-support@huddinge.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Huddinge kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.huddinge.se"}},{"@id":"https://metadatakatalog.huddinge.se/store/25/resource/1","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:name":"Kultur- och fritidsförvaltningen"},{"@id":"https://metadatakatalog.huddinge.se/store/25/resource/115","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Kultur- och fritidsförvaltningen","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:kulturfritid@huddinge.se"}},{"@id":"https://metadatakatalog.huddinge.se/store/2